https://github.com/kevinCsir/beegent

The imported HarmonyOS client and LAN relay retain their original authorship.
Android development and repository presentation are maintained in XiaoLuoLYG/beegent.
The original Git history is retained.

No open-source license was declared in the imported repository snapshot, and
this repository does not assign a new license to that code. Publication of this
repository is not a relicensing of upstream work. Dependencies retain their own
licenses. BeeGent is a companion client, not an official endorsement by the
platform vendors or the WorkSwarm / JiuwenSwarm projects.

The BeeGent icon, hero and brand overview were generated with AI assistance
using user-supplied visual references. Original reference files are not included.
